label school_nursehall:
    scene school_nursehall with dissolve_fast
    $ location_images = ['school_nurseoffice', 'school_courtyard']
    $ location_labels = ['school_nurseoffice', 'school_courtyard']
    show screen move

    call screen location_selector(location_images, location_labels) with dissolve_fast
    return

label school_nursehall_7h_0:
    
    "I find myself wandering the school grounds until I reach the auxiliary building before the nurse office."

    "I don't know why I came here. Is it to find a moment of respite from the noise outside?"

    "Anyways, since I'm already here, I might as well ask the Nurse for some sleeping pills. I've been struggling these last few days."

    "I'm not sure if it's the side effect of my new medication, or I am just too restless to sleep soundly lately."

    "I approach the door to knock, but the room is unlit. It doesn't seem like anyone is inside."

    "I knock anyway."

    ".."

    "..."

    "Okay... I guess he's not here. Bummer."

    "I guess there is nothing to do except get back to the courtyard then."

    "Just as I turn to head back, I see a man walking towards me. He seems like the Nurse, but not in his usual white cloth, instead he fashions a chemise and jeans."

    Nurse "Hisao, what are you doing here so early? I hope it's not some emergency. You know you could have called the nightshift nurse's hotline, right?"

    Hisao "Oh no, no. It's not urgent. I'm just wandering around."

    "The Nurse has a puzzled expression."

    Nurse "Then what a particular choice to come here, Hisao. You know they have a festival out there, right?"

    "He points his finger, stating the obvious."

    Hisao "I know... I'm just here to ask for some sleeping pills. I couldn't sleep well last night, and there is no good sleeping in today, is it?"

    "The Nurse upon hearing that, switches into his usual pensive mood."

    Nurse "I am quite hesitant..."

    "He signals to me as he opens the door to his office."

    Nurse "You are taking quite a heavy combination of meds. We don't even know how your body is reacting to your pills. The last thing we want is to add to the pile."

    "He takes a dossier and flips it open, scanning the pages."

    Nurse "So nothing induces insomnia. This is not a dianogsis, but I'm thinking that you're just having problem due to new environment and such."

    Hisao "I think so too. But I've never had it before, even when I'm in the hospital."

    Nurse "Well, your body was considerably weaker back then so that wouldn't surprise me."

    "He pauses to think."

    Nurse "I'll tell you what, Hisao. If it's not too serious, let us observe it for the following weeks, if your insomnia doesn't improve, I'll contact the hospital to potentially add sleeping pills to your prescription, how does that sound?"

    Hisao "Okay, I'll look into it."

    Nurse "And one more thing Hisao."

    "He says as he crosses his arms, trying to be serious but failing at the seams."

    Nurse "A little birdy told me that Hisao has not been keeping up with his promise..."

    Hisao "Emi?"

    Nurse "Emi."

    Nurse "You know exercising help you sleep better at night right? I can't force you to jog, but at least take up some form of exercises. Your body's in desperate need of it to not repeat the same incident."

    Nurse "You were lucky the first time that there is someone to call for immediate help. We can't predict when or where the next scare will come. So I need you to take care of your self, for your sake."

    Nurse "The goal is to stabilize your condition so that you can continue to college next year without needing constant supervision."
    
    Nurse "If your condition doesn't improve by then, I'm afraid you will have to repeat the year."


